<h2 id="desirables-section-lisse-etale" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="02BN">113.11</span> Lisse étale site of an algebraic stack</h2>

<p>
This has been introduced in Cohomology of Stacks, Section <a href="/tag/0786" data-tag="0786">103.14</a>. An example to show that it is not functorial with respect to $1$-morphisms of algebraic stacks is discussed in Examples, Section <a href="/tag/07BF" data-tag="07BF">110.60</a>. Of course a lot more could be said about this, but it turns out to be very useful to prove things using the “big” étale site as much as possible. 
</p>
